  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da67049b48a4dfc842480327",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单又吃不腻，份量管够的披萨\\n为努力的大家提供力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7c3e088bed71edc06f938d57ce3c0cac024822bff557aa32297f6612f14553",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a5a85a87b3356935ca0692",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "利用土豆胡萝卜的甘甜，让不擅长吃辣的\\n赛马娘都为之着迷的绝品麻婆豆腐",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a5d7f84eba31c90985b2eeb1de8e2eff0a8bb0dfc55c65a906b1cc2ee5fb1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a05c69088407097d1ebd59c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "利用土豆胡萝卜的甘甜，让不擅长吃辣的\\n赛马娘都为之着迷的绝品麻婆豆腐",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a5d7f84eba31c90985b2eeb1de8e2eff0a8bb0dfc55c65a906b1cc2ee5fb1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c1218a7117e5c7be5c493de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "添加胡萝卜的草莓冰淇淋\\n美味甜点让心灵也得到放松",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec4c921668bf3d223b4692bc0bddc0fe5ba5589a8b837c9291a530aa62b13be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b956ba20522086717fc48473",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "添加胡萝卜的草莓冰淇淋\\n美味甜点让心灵也得到放松",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec4c921668bf3d223b4692bc0bddc0fe5ba5589a8b837c9291a530aa62b13be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba84c47e07563d2763a50bdd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用足足一根胡萝卜的豪华炖汤\\n绝对让你食指大动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d59cee1f540b5627dabf17bb6288f57491c7b25b11f1ef426ac3803f771a04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9cfb9dab132d34b65434c9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是蔬菜们的秘密温泉。吃上一口就能消除疲劳，\\n健步如飞，很厉害的料理",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b8dcfa17165a710265f1892f5ebb349fd00278f3adf4af6f89390beeefd190",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:382fc248e12c009696109036",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "浸泡在温泉里的蔬菜好似绘本的世界\\n所有人都露出幸福的笑容，温暖的一道菜",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f5c6bfff4a539d5ab8ecb2b12a45a05e9a5ed8feb7197ef11b742d6ab901f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81b72f4794b58cb747ff9531",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "引人注目的一整颗大蒜，震惊的料理。\\n吃了它精神一万倍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72a96856ea0f87ac015793b970e867ad9fa595a7b88508a138b459bcf863c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e53102e8137020bafb8b4c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耸立的大蒜山，如果能顺利登顶\\n据说就能获得无限的耐力",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe6e9b8c603b064b9b32e8eedd6672c839a38d73c9f30ea6dd596846cce409f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac2610900abde031f4c8106",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃起来方便的两种三明治\\n胡萝卜的口感很爽脆",
      "source_fingerprint": "237025d026065c4cfb18fc730f06004d094b4b058ec96b1925c80e0af236caa8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc669f1fb78ca4db21ba3e74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "几度将挑战者拒之门外，食物的最高峰\\n向着蒜的山顶进发，加油嗷！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8e15958e5b021d0bbdd7bf047dda462c030aa2184d3d997524cba202843732",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88fb6d16404e0e023ac52fee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "土豆披萨上撒有嫩如新芽的罗勒\\n感受大地蓬勃的力量吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "9794da8e5467b1ffc8786cb3508f9199fa8c59c9edc19cf2062f09a2a71ae989",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e1f3eecd534e85d4aab7ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沿逆时针揉面团，手法早已熟练\\n吃下热乎乎的披萨，目标是东京高手",
      "source_fingerprint": "56820ff24a3776ce59c6662d8325dd8e513c89eefdb0051f86fd7a10bf2d8adc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d283cd12450dd4f8f606d8c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用最好的食材制作的最好的舞台！\\n佳肴美味自然会让大家喜笑颜开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eafbddd619a6143c1f7690f5d0a88c2b9b4568af9d8dd18de22cdae36c65be51",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290f283c0eaaab73971c1d34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给感觉不够辣的人下的挑战书\\n让你汗流浃背大汗淋漓",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb3bc50534d1a19b44bb6df3714fff633a8fd445dc16170a44465542c3cea6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb09a62892896395d65f6bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "它的辣让所有人心惊胆战，可怕的料理\\n要想吃到看见锅底，需要很强的毅力",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b9e455aabe29af638c4ce8e1ab55deda4d6068fa3c4112c06f56c2cff66a1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1fe874a4f03c04ca90e54cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "敢于面对地狱辣度，那就是王牌的样子\\n吃完就倒是自己的秘密 ",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5c3e2393c96328f028804a33182a9c0b2d555ea46e712748d2c0507a9347e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e162f669371a0d5b806f33f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多加一个胡萝卜冰淇淋球更加豪华\\n两种味道演奏幸福的和声",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa48a4ada937d45f96bf1bd596196a3496c467e3cd4efab53bde07d1cb1bce04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de93f040fd2e67cb66398ecb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只是放在了上面。仅仅如此就让心灵震撼\\n只是放在了上面。仅仅如此就让世界改变",
      "source_fingerprint": "49be8f44ba072d8e66708c642067aa1485a1ab4fbde8c802ce7e0b07b02d8328",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b498edb9cc2781fb0056006",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可靠的孩子也会休息一下补充营养！\\n营养丰富又香甜，离大人又进了一步吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f8288c260bc804673398f8e52d32c1a2636eafe025f99afe8982ea11b849a3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47cd6b4606b7736b581bac5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "发挥胡萝卜甘甜的咖喱\\n加入大蒜片是点睛之笔",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc70c7b5b28c3b56ac489c2255d5e2427aee01e5a1a0fad785f0fb66ab36507",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6777c3ed659996d7f840acf1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其中所有料理均为GⅠ级。\\n作为对精通料理者的奖励，与大家共进的最佳美食",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad3674558f74d86a5b3a8280e66dac35b1ca303a20f3c6b105393bf6aa704af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c05749509180e7fe793dda60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其中所有料理均为GⅠ级。\\n作为对精通料理者的奖励，与大家共进的最佳美食",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad3674558f74d86a5b3a8280e66dac35b1ca303a20f3c6b105393bf6aa704af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883e06fbff261d9418176e41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "发挥胡萝卜甘甜的咖喱\\n加入大蒜片是点睛之笔",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc70c7b5b28c3b56ac489c2255d5e2427aee01e5a1a0fad785f0fb66ab36507",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed63dec97d36acb5fe0ec949",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "加入大块胡萝卜和土豆的豪华炖汤\\n口感十足！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79acb81b59425cb6120725c87296705aaadeaecbe0d3eb9dba4fdacd68692c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8609a6376a7ca5c2181ce237",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "加入大块胡萝卜和土豆的豪华炖汤\\n口感十足！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79acb81b59425cb6120725c87296705aaadeaecbe0d3eb9dba4fdacd68692c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303baca526dbbf69fe951332",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分展现大蒜风味的耐力向食谱\\n让人暂时放下烦恼的一道菜",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fbfe3b453fedde5f7839c8020b1a87ac25273a4dd7ab254eccacdba9d532f5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad9ff4c765dd2e5dbb5b253",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分展现大蒜风味的耐力向食谱\\n让人暂时放下烦恼的一道菜",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fbfe3b453fedde5f7839c8020b1a87ac25273a4dd7ab254eccacdba9d532f5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5a033299cf88e8e07d770a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单又吃不腻，份量管够的披萨\\n为努力的大家提供力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7c3e088bed71edc06f938d57ce3c0cac024822bff557aa32297f6612f14553",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "353",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5068661460c8d8872d9d4e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "料理获得大成功时，可以获得技能折扣！\\n此外，料理还将追加1个以上效果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa1e1adeb3dfe3a1749c27fc92894a91755c71e2f1ea8e197a630867519e656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "354",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ab21ed1d41575005868cfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大成功时的追加效果因料理而异！\\n究竟会追加什么还请期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd7c52235d99f544e8d54b8907af5a1c9fd583c0e9da1192fe1cf42ce3480e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "354",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0f09177736d665e10714323",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对料理的热情高涨了！\\n毫无疑问会是大成功！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a5a15d2fcd66af533070e380a9babd1c12e3d5e050376e05bd0e5dc9c18774a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "354",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a968da449ce8a57cad3a8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "・料理获得大成功时，可以获得技能折扣。\\n・获得大成功的料理将追加1个以上效果。\\n・追加效果因料理而异。\\n・每次制作料理时，获得的料理Pt会使\\n　烹饪量表上升。\\n・当烹饪量表达到最大状态时，\\n　料理必为大成功。\\n・烹饪量表达到最大状态时，制作料理后，\\n　烹饪量表将会被重置。\\n・重置后，量表可再次上升。\\n・烹饪量表被重置时，超过1,500的部分以及\\n　在量表最大状态下制作料理所增加的\\n　量表值将会被保留。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4c61c1a3093691cf6e418822a70c44dcd4220311ee12d0ffe9131b6f3d919c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "354",
        "4"
      ]
    },
